                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does telemedicine platform cost?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: ₹40-80 lakh ($48K-96K). Growth: ₹1-2.5 Cr ($120K-300K). Enterprise hospital-integrated: ₹2.5-6 Cr ($300K-720K).</p>
                                        <h3>Twilio or 100ms for video?</h3>
                                        <p>Twilio if global + proven. 100ms if India-heavy or budget-sensitive. Both quality-competitive.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I use GPT-4 for symptom triage?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes with strict guardrails — must escalate red-flag symptoms, cannot diagnose, must be clear to patient it's triage not diagnosis.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest telemedicine failure mode?</h3>
                                        <p>Under-investing in doctor UX. Doctors are the constraint, not patients. If the doctor app is painful, doctors don't use it.</p>
